---
import Layout from '../../layouts/concepts/ModernCorporateLayout.astro';
import Services from '../../components/concepts/modern-corporate/Services.astro';
import Projects from '../../components/concepts/modern-corporate/Projects.astro';
---
<Layout title="Digital growth, thoughtfully connected">
  <section class="corporate-hero container"><div><p class="eyebrow">Berlin / Digital marketing & technology</p><h1>Good thinking.<br />Stronger <em>digital</em><br />possibilities.</h1><p>Connecting research, visibility and thoughtful digital experiences to help businesses build a stronger online presence.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/concept-01/services/">Explore our services ↗</a><a href="/concept-01/about/" class="text-link">The thinking behind it</a></div></div>
    <div class="corporate-art" role="img" aria-label="Abstract connected blue planes representing research, visibility and experience"><div class="orbital orbital-one"></div><div class="orbital orbital-two"></div><div class="art-core"></div><span class="art-word word-one">RESEARCH</span><span class="art-word word-two">VISIBILITY</span><span class="art-word word-three">EXPERIENCE</span><p>Connected by strategy.</p></div>
  </section>
  <div class="corporate-marquee"><div class="container"><span>Research first.</span><span>Purposeful visibility.</span><span>Thoughtful experiences.</span><span>Lasting relationships.</span></div></div>
  <section class="corporate-section container"><div class="corporate-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Our capabilities</p><h2>Growth takes<br />a connected approach.</h2></div><p>From understanding your audience to caring for your digital presence, every part should work together.</p></div><Services /></section>
  <section class="approach-section"><div class="container approach-grid"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Our perspective</p><div><h2>See the whole picture.<br />Make the next move count.</h2><p>A marketing-first perspective brings clarity to the role of every digital touchpoint. Technology supports that direction, from the first search to the next conversation.</p><a href="/concept-01/about/" class="text-link">Explore our approach ↗</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="corporate-section container"><div class="corporate-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Portfolio framework</p><h2>Space for the work<br />to tell its story.</h2></div><p>Project names from the supplied brief. Case studies and approved visuals will follow source verification.</p></div><Projects /></section>
  <section class="corporate-cta container"><p class="eyebrow">A conversation starts here</p><h2>What could your<br />next chapter look like?</h2><a class="button" href="/concept-01/contact/">Explore the contact demo ↗</a><p>Presentation only. No enquiries are sent.</p></section>
</Layout>
